// Title: PUA - Advanced Port Scanner Execution
// ID: 54773c5f-f1cc-4703-9126-2f797d96a69d
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-12-18
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1046, attack.t1135
// Description: Detects the use of Advanced Port Scanner.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_/portable*" and process.command_line like "*_/lng*")) or ((process.executable like "*_\\advanced_port_scanner*") or (process.pe.original_file_name like "*_advanced_port_scanner*") or (Description like "*_Advanced Port Scanner*")))
